            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This datasets describes the production of high-grade tellurium (99.999%) from copper-telluride cementate by hydrometallurgical processes. These hydrometallurgical processes are the dissolving of copper-telluride cementate with sulphuric acid, the following electrolysis and subsequent purification with zone-melting. This purity of tellurium can be used in the production of thin film solar cells. ;
CAS number: 013494-80-9; 
Formula: Te; 
UUID: fedd6220-a891-3a5c-801b-8a254383130b</common:generalComment>
